# Testing Smoke

Mother rule: `.ai/instructions/testing-smoke.md`.

Read `MEMORY.md` and `AI_BOARD.md` before editing.

- Record commands and pass/fail/skipped reasons.
- Do not delete or skip tests to manufacture a pass.
- Prefer `go test ./...` and `go build ./cmd/edge-backend` for backend gates.
- Realtime/control changes need smoke evidence or an explicit blocked reason.
